      "version": "2.40.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Enjoy additionally enhanced UI features with the purchase of the Remove All Ads option:\n* Animated grid floor in the main menu for an immersive experience.\n* Experience our revamped button UI in the main menu.\n* New button UI and cool touch animations for HBFS and TECHNOLOGIC.\n* More similar updates will follow for those who accessed the full experience!",
