    },
    {
      "version": "2.41.0",
      "releaseNotes": "More updated UI for users who bought the ENHANCED UI package together with removing all ads. (currently on an exceptionally good deal price!)\n\nIn the package:\n* Removes ALL ads!\n* Updated button UI.\n* Updated button effects and animations.\n* Multiple layouts for HBFS.\n* Optional color combinations on HBFS.\n* Always easy access to WHOPPER without first watching an ad.\n- More to come in the future which will be automatically included in the special deal!",
      "seenAt": "2024-02-07T00:33:52Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.42.0",
      "releaseNotes": "New car game included in the enhanced version (IAP) (work in progress). \nCollect time rings and complete each level to let our duo deliver fresh beats to the recording studio.",
